{"id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-combinatory-logic.md","title":"SKI 组合逻辑","display":"df-combinatory-logic — SKI 组合逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-combinatory-logic","aliases":["56-df-combinatory-logic"],"display":"df-combinatory-logic — SKI 组合逻辑","depends_on":["[[56-df-applicative-trs]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Tables 3.1–3.3, printed pp64–65","source_ocr_block":"85–86","source_status":"rules-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-combinatory-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-combinatory-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-combinatory-logic — SKI 组合逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da4ab3df97a0b08\" href=\"?note=1da4ab3df97a0b08\" title=\"56-df-applicative-trs\">56-df-applicative-trs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Tables 3.1–3.3, printed pp64–65"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"85–86"},{"key":"source_status","html":"rules-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取四个两两不同的函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\">\\(S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\)</span> 和可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\cap\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\}=\\varnothing\">\\(V\\cap\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K,I\">\\(S,K,I\\)</span> 的元数为0，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ap}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ap}\\)</span> 的元数为2。采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1da4ab3df97a0b08\" href=\"?note=1da4ab3df97a0b08\" title=\"56-df-applicative-trs\">56-df-applicative-trs</a> 的左结合应用记法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V\">\\(x,y,z\\in V\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为集合参数；规则中的变量可按替换任意实例化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(S)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(K)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(I)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(S)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(K)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(I)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{CL}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}),\\qquad T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}},V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{CL}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}),\\qquad T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}},V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{(Sxyz,xz(yz)),(Kxy,x),(Ix,x)\\},\\qquad\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{CL}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{(Sxyz,xz(yz)),(Kxy,x),(Ix,x)\\},\\qquad\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{CL}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\land\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\land\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Tables 3.1–3.3（印刷 pp64–65，OCR 页块85–86）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,K,I\">\\(S,K,I\\)</span> 是零元符号，其“需要的参数数”由左部应用链长度决定，不能误填入签名元数。组合子指闭 CL 项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-applicative-trs","status":"resolved","id":"1da4ab3df97a0b08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-applicative-trs]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-applicative-trs","status":"resolved","id":"1da4ab3df97a0b08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取四个两两不同的函数符号 $S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}$ 和可数无限变量集 $V$，假定 $V\\cap\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\}=\\varnothing$。其中 $S,K,I$ 的元数为0，$\\mathsf{Ap}$ 的元数为2。采用 [[56-df-applicative-trs]] 的左结合应用记法。$x,y,z\\in V$ 两两不同，$t$ 为集合参数；规则中的变量可按替换任意实例化。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\cap\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"S,K,I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ap}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"F_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{S,K,I,\\mathsf{Ap}\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(S)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(K)=\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(I)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{CL}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{CL}}),\\qquad T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{CL}},V).","display":true},{"tex":"R_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\{(Sxyz,xz(yz)),(Kxy,x),(Ix,x)\\},\\qquad\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\coloneqq\\to_{R_{\\mathrm{CL}}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(t)\\Longleftrightarrow t\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\land\\mathrm{Var}(t)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"S,K,I","display":false}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"223292dccac5188a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6516afd3f4dc57b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $Y\\in T_{\\mathrm{CL}}$，$x\\in V$。$\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{CL}}^*$ 是 CL 归约的转换闭包；$\\mathrm{Combinator}_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 见 [[56-df-combinatory-logic]]。"},{"id":"ff338b5fa0b80bc1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"令 $D=SII$，$M=DD$，CL 与 $\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 见 [[56-df-combinatory-logic]]。$\\mathrm{Terminating}(A,\\to)$ 是沿归约方向无无限链，见 [[56-df-terminating]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-273","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-combinatory-logic.md]]"}],"outgoing":["1da4ab3df97a0b08","a3b60e1e9cdeef27"]}